@alife-records 1

node vp_1289.VQ_HOUSE_BATH
  t.any.1 Hands and face would be good.. where's the water?
  t.any.2 Yes please.. don't want to bring the whole road into bed with me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_HOUSE_BED
  t.any.1 Would lie down once I'm warmer.. thank you
  t.any.2 Yes.. rather a bed than another shed floor
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_HOUSE_CHAIR
  t.any.1 Gladly.. knees have done enough bending for now
  t.any.2 Thank you.. mind if I keep my things beside my feet?
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_HOUSE_CHORES
  t.any.1 Something light to begin with.. can look at cupboards too if needed
  t.any.2 Can carry things where you want them.. ask before giving me the whole room
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_HOUSE_PHONE
  t.any.1 Would call my parents if a call can get through.. know the number
  t.any.2 Willie would be my second try.. he might know where my parents went
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_HOUSE_PRAYER
  t.any.1 A minute would be welcome.. you needn't leave on my account
  t.any.2 Yes please.. won't need you to find anything for me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_HOUSE_RADIO
  t.any.1 Weather first if we can find it.. music after, if you like
  t.any.2 Please try.. would listen rather than keep explaining myself
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_HOUSE_WELCOME
  t.any.1 Thank you.. where would you rather I leave my boots?
  t.any.2 Would like to rest near people.. don't need a room to myself
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_NOW_CARRYING
  gate.rule trust>=15
  t.any.1 Rule, notebook, lake photograph.. eighty-six dollars behind the photograph's backing.. saved my wages for a barbell.. father thinks spare money goes into the house.. haven't told him about this
  fx.1 reveal f_barbell
  fx.2 set flag:money_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_NOW_CARRYING.d
  t.any.1 My own small things.. photograph and a folding rule
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1289.VQ_NOW_CARRYING.d2
  t.any.1 Tools and something from home.. not opening everything yet
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1289.VQ_NOW_COLD
  t.any.1 Yes.. a blanket, please.. can't seem to get warm
  t.any.2 Cold through my back.. would like something round me before I try resting
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_NOW_HELP
  gate.rule need:cold>=2
  t.any.1 Cupboards and doors.. let me warm up before trying anything
  t.any.2 Can carry, but warm up first please.. strength isn't much use when I'm shivering
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_NOW_HELP.d
  t.any.1 Cupboards and doors are my trade.. can carry things too
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1289.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY
  gate.rule need:hunger>=2
  t.any.1 Would eat.. no need to make a special meal for me
  t.any.2 Hungry enough.. the bread in the shed wasn't a grand feast
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY.d
  t.any.1 Not hungry just now.. could wait awhile
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1289.VQ_NOW_HURT
  t.any.1 Knees ached on the walk.. could you check what needs attention?
  t.any.2 Had sore legs coming here.. rather have somebody look than guess about the rest
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_NOW_PLAN
  t.any.1 Rest awhile, then try for Lebanon
  t.any.2 Parents' house if I can get there.. not promising how quickly
  t.any.3 Want to see what's possible before I say yes to anything
  t.any.4 Haven't decided. Would like somebody to talk it over with, not choose it for me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_NOW_THIRSTY
  gate.rule need:thirst>=2
  t.any.1 Yes.. water would be welcome
  t.any.2 Would drink some water.. mouth's dry enough to make talking tiresome
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_NOW_THIRSTY.d
  t.any.1 Not thirsty at present.. can leave the water for somebody else
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1289.VQ_NOW_TIRED
  t.any.1 Could rest.. slept on hay before coming here, don't want another floor
  t.any.2 Tired.. would prefer a proper bed to thinking about the shed
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_NOW_TRUST
  t.lo.1 Enough to ask where I may put my things
  t.mid.1 Yes.. still expect to be asked before you look through the notebook
  t.hi.1 Trust you.. don't agree that I need cheering up every time I'm quiet
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_NOW_WANT
  gate.rule need:cold>=2
  t.any.1 Blanket.. not fussy what colour it is
  t.any.2 Warmth first.. can ask my questions when my teeth stop meeting
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_NOW_WANT.d
  t.any.1 Warm enough just now.. would enjoy company a while
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1289.VQ_OFFER_BLANKET
  t.any.1 Yes please.. that's what I came to ask for
  t.any.2 Would be glad of one.. can fold it when I'm done
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_OFFER_BOOK
  t.any.1 Pictures if there's a choice.. I like seeing how somebody drew things
  t.any.2 Would read a little.. can't promise my eyes will stay open
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_OFFER_DRINK
  t.any.1 Something to drink would be kind.. water is fine
  t.any.2 Yes please.. don't go to trouble making it hot unless you were already doing that
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_OFFER_FOOD
  t.any.1 Will eat what's offered.. just tell me where I should take it
  t.any.2 Yes.. mother would tell me not to turn down food and then stand around hungry
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_BOSS
  t.any.1 Vernon would let me finish a mistake before saying anything.. sometimes I'd rather he'd shouted
  t.any.2 Worked with Vernon Pace first.. made a good door and a poor lunch
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_CHILDHOOD
  t.any.1 Riverside till twelve.. always trying to carry more than I was asked
  t.any.2 Grew up with a younger brother.. Reuben could talk me into most things I didn't want to do
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_CHURCH
  t.any.1 Mennonite.. went with my family, still go when I can
  t.any.2 Yes.. liked the singing and the meal afterward.. don't ask me to choose which
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_DAYONE
  t.any.1 Hanging cupboard doors.. man who lived there brought in the warnings before I heard a broadcast
  t.any.2 At a job near Lebanon.. left the last pair of doors unhung
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_FAMILY
  t.any.1 Miriam and Amos.. my parents near Lebanon.. don't know whether they're still there
  t.any.2 Parents are the ones I want to get back to.. no recent word
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_FIRSTJOB
  t.any.1 Vernon Pace paid me to help with cupboards in eighty-three.. started sweeping
  t.any.2 Carrying boards for Vernon.. he taught me the rest when I stopped rushing
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_HOBBY
  gate.rule trust>=45 & alone & flag:stranger_told
  t.any.1 Lifting, and drawing comic pictures of the lifting club.. notebook's mine.. Willie is in most of them, looking ridiculous.. rather enjoy making him look that way.. he doesn't know, want to keep it so
  fx.1 reveal f_drawings
  fx.2 set flag:drawings_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_HOBBY.d
  t.any.1 Weights in Willie's kitchen when it rained.. liked improving a little at a time
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_HOBBY.d2
  t.any.1 Lifting with friends.. keeping the other pastime to myself today
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_HOUSE
  t.any.1 Parents' place near Lebanon.. my room had the smallest window
  t.any.2 Lived at home.. father kept finding jobs for a carpenter who lived under his roof
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_LASTNORMAL
  t.any.1 Mother sent me back to wash my hands.. hadn't touched anything dirty since washing, she said she couldn't tell
  t.any.2 Willie moving his wife's kitchen chairs to make room.. asking us to remember which went where
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_LOST
  gate.rule trust>=75 & alone & flag:timber_told & gave:blanket
  t.any.1 Reuben, my brother.. drowned in eighty, he was eleven.. when they told us, one part of me was relieved I wouldn't have to look after him anymore.. only for a moment.. loved him.. never said that thought aloud before.. let me keep this blanket close
  fx.1 reveal f_relief
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_LOST.d
  t.any.1 My brother Reuben died in eighty.. would rather leave it there
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_LOST.d2
  t.any.1 Reuben.. no, not going further with that now
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_LOST.d3
  t.any.1 Please stop asking about my brother for a while
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_PHOTO
  t.any.1 That's me at the lake in eighty-seven.. Becca was behind the camera.. her red swim cap in my hand
  t.any.2 Cousin Becca took it.. I wasn't posing, just holding her things while she went swimming
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_PROUD
  t.any.1 First cupboard I finished without Vernon taking over.. stood looking at it too long
  t.any.2 Could lift more by last winter than I could the winter before.. pleased me, no prize involved
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL
  t.any.1 Finished school in eighty-three.. went straight into cupboard work
  t.any.2 Riverside first, then near Lebanon.. liked drawing things to scale
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_TRAVEL
  t.any.1 Trips round Kentucky for work.. haven't been a great distance
  t.any.2 Riverside and Lebanon, mostly.. still plenty of streets I don't know in either
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_WORK
  gate.rule trust>=60 & alone & flag:drawings_told
  t.any.1 Carpenter.. doors and cupboards.. cheated Len Arnett in eighty-nine.. charged him for new timber, used salvaged boards and wrote a false receipt.. kept the difference.. cupboard was sound, bill wasn't honest
  fx.1 reveal f_timber
  fx.2 set flag:timber_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_WORK.d
  t.any.1 Made doors and cupboards.. joined the union in eighty-six
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_WORK.d2
  t.any.1 Carpentry.. don't want to go through my old accounts here
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1289.VQ_PAST_WORK.d3
  t.any.1 I've told you the trade.. leave the rest for now
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_AGE
  t.any.1 Twenty-eight.. born sixty-five
  t.any.2 Twenty-eight.. Willie says I ought to lift more at my age
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_DISLIKES
  t.any.1 Being called strong when somebody wants a free moving man
  t.any.2 Willie counting a lift I didn't finish.. I know he means well, still dislike it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_FEAR
  t.any.1 Thunder.. don't enjoy waiting for the next crack
  t.any.2 Storm starting while I'm away from shelter.. that's the one
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_FOOD
  t.any.1 Mother's potatoes with browned butter.. could eat them without anything else
  t.any.2 Peaches sliced into a bowl.. don't need them made into a grand dessert
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_FROM
  t.any.1 Near Lebanon.. Riverside when I was small
  t.any.2 Came from my parents' place outside Lebanon
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_HABIT
  t.any.1 Opening the folding rule.. loose hinge catches my finger if I don't watch
  t.any.2 Thumb on the photograph's corner.. keeping it from catching on my shirt
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_HOMECOOK
  t.any.1 Mother mostly.. father considered slicing bread his contribution
  t.any.2 Miriam, my mother.. I'd peel things if she'd let me stay in the kitchen
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_HOPE
  t.any.1 Parents still at their table.. I'd like to find both places occupied
  t.any.2 Want to hear Willie ask for six good lifts again.. be glad even if I couldn't do them
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_HOWARE
  t.lo.1 Glad to stop travelling a while
  t.lo.2 Noah.. not much use at answering quickly
  t.mid.1 Missing the noise at Willie's house
  t.mid.2 Too many people I'd like news of
  t.mid.3 Still deciding. Can I tell you when I've worked it out?
  t.mid.4 I keep looking for something to do instead of answering that
  t.mid.5 Better being allowed to ask an ordinary question back
  t.hi.1 Don't want to be told I'm bearing it well.. would rather talk about something else
  t.hi.2 Glad of company.. not glad of needing help
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_JOKE
  t.any.1 Willie put the weights in his kitchen.. said his wife could finally see what was taking so long.. she said she already knew: resting
  t.any.2 Made a button too large for my shirt.. Vernon said to build a larger shirt.. still have the button
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_LIKES
  t.any.1 Lifting weights.. six good lifts please me more than a lot of poor ones
  t.any.2 A long meal with everybody still at the table.. no one hurrying me out
  t.any.3 Being shown a way I haven't tried, without being laughed at for asking
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_MUSIC
  t.any.1 Singing together.. I can hold a tune if somebody starts it
  t.any.2 Fiddle music when it's on.. never learned to play, despite asking people how
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_NAME
  t.any.1 Noah Stoltzfus.. Noah will do
  t.any.2 Stoltzfus.. you can ask me to say it again, I won't mind
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_PRAYER
  t.any.1 Yes.. sometimes only people's names, can't find more words
  t.any.2 Pray most days.. don't much care to have an audience for it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_QUIET
  t.any.1 Certainly.. don't have to fill every minute
  t.any.2 Would like that.. leave me within hearing, though
  t.any.3 Yes. I don't need to prove I'm useful every minute I'm here
  t.any.4 You can stay. We can think our separate thoughts for a bit
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_SLEEP
  t.any.1 Slept a few hours in a hay shed before coming on.. kept waking cold
  t.any.2 Not enough.. would rather lie down than discuss how little
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_STORY
  t.mid.1 Willie's kitchen was our lifting room when it rained.. he tried to stand the weights behind a curtain.. whole thing fell over while his wife had visitors.. we were carrying potatoes in ten minutes, she said that was useful lifting
  t.hi.1 Becca took my lake picture in eighty-seven.. handed me her red swim cap, said hold that.. took the picture before I knew it.. spent a year hearing that I looked better holding a hat than wearing one
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_TALK_WEATHER
  t.any.1 Haven't a useful rain prediction.. would like a dry stretch
  t.any.2 No good at guessing when it will rain.. always pack as though it won't
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_WORLD_CHURCH
  t.any.1 Don't know who's still meeting.. left before I could find out
  t.any.2 No recent church news.. would like to find somebody from our congregation
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_WORLD_DEAD
  gate.rule trust>=30 & flag:money_told
  t.any.1 Still people to me.. found a dead man beside the Lebanon road.. two fellows mocking him, so I said I knew him.. never saw him before.. they left when I said it.. didn't feel obliged to tell them the truth afterward
  fx.1 reveal f_stranger
  fx.2 set flag:stranger_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_WORLD_DEAD.d
  t.any.1 People.. don't think that stops because they're dead
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1289.VQ_WORLD_DEAD.d2
  t.any.1 Don't like the way people treat them.. leave it at that
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1289.VQ_WORLD_HOPE
  t.any.1 Yes.. don't know how long it takes, still think we can live through it
  t.any.2 Hoping isn't difficult for me.. waiting without going to look is
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_WORLD_KIDS
  t.any.1 Haven't seen a child on this last stretch.. hope they're indoors
  t.any.2 No children with me.. if food's short I'd put them ahead of myself
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_WORLD_NEWS
  t.any.1 Man I was making cupboards for brought warnings.. heard them on a radio afterward.. nothing useful since
  t.any.2 People on the road were trying to reach family.. no clear word about Lebanon
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.VQ_WORLD_ROAD
  t.any.1 Got through on foot.. had to leave the road around some cars
  t.any.2 Couldn't promise a wagon or car would pass where I walked
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1289.leave.angry
  t.any.1 Would prefer not to stay.. leaving now
  t.any.2 No more from me.. had enough
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1289.leave.plain
  t.any.1 My things are together.. should go
  t.any.2 Noah Stoltzfus.. word from Lebanon would mean a great deal to me
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1289.react.gave_blanket
  gate.rule gave:blanket
  t.any.1 That's welcome.. thank you for sharing it
  t.any.2 Good.. can stop trying to pull my sleeves over my hands
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1289.react.gave_book
  gate.rule gave:book
  t.any.1 Thank you.. will look through it before deciding what I think
  t.any.2 Something else to occupy me.. good of you
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1289.react.gave_food
  gate.rule gave:food
  t.any.1 Thank you for the food.. won't leave that unsaid
  t.any.2 Glad of it.. mother would want me to ask if you've kept enough for yourself
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1289.react.gave_water
  gate.rule gave:water
  t.any.1 Water helps.. thank you
  t.any.2 Appreciate your sharing.. hadn't carried enough myself
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1289.react.insult
  t.any.1 Didn't care for that
  t.any.2 You can dislike me without making a performance of it
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1289.react.refused
  t.any.1 All right.. I won't keep asking
  t.any.2 Disappointed.. still heard your answer
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1289.react.thanks
  t.any.1 You're welcome.. no difficulty saying that
  t.any.2 Glad I could.. don't require anything back
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1289.react.threat
  t.any.1 No.. don't want a fight here
  t.any.2 Let me gather my own things.. can go without anybody getting hurt
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1289.return.arrive
  gate.rule visits>=1
  t.any.1 Noah again.. found my way back
  t.any.2 Stoltzfus.. would be glad to stop here another while
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1289.return.gave_food
  gate.rule visits>=1 & gaveever:food
  t.any.1 Remember your sharing food with me.. didn't mean to let that go unmentioned
  t.any.2 Came back thinking I ought to thank you for the food.. there, have done it now
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1296.VQ_HOUSE_BED
  t.any.1 Yes, please.. somewhere dry matters more than how soft it is
  t.any.2 Could use it.. say when it must be free again
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_HOUSE_PRAYER
  t.any.1 Yes.. a short quiet minute would be welcome
  t.any.2 Thank you.. may pray without asking anybody else to kneel
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_HOUSE_SAFE
  t.any.1 Glad you say so.. what can we hear from this room?
  t.any.2 Want to believe it.. won't ask you to guarantee what happens outside
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_HOUSE_WARM
  t.any.1 Still deciding whether another layer would help.. don't want you fussing
  t.any.2 Yes.. shoulders haven't agreed to relax yet, but the air helps
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_HOUSE_WELCOME
  t.any.1 Gracias.. tell me where the bag won't be in anybody's way
  t.any.2 Thank you.. don't need to inspect rooms you haven't offered
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_HOUSE_WINDOW
  t.any.1 Would look for swallows first.. haven't identified anything yet, just looking
  t.any.2 That view's new to me.. give me a moment before asking what moved
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_NOW_CARRYING
  t.any.1 Julia's binoculars and my notebook.. neither is worth reaching into my bag without asking
  t.any.2 Pencil, room key, old ticket.. not much weight until the hill starts
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_NOW_HELP
  t.any.1 Farm work when rested.. ask about the job before deciding I'm fit for the heavy end
  t.any.2 Can describe birds I know.. cannot read danger from every bird that leaves a tree
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY
  t.any.1 Yes.. been answering that with later for too long
  t.any.2 Hungry enough to stop choosing.. whatever is ordinary food here would help
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_NOW_HURT
  gate.rule trust>=42 & alone & partnerGone & flag:dog_told
  t.hi.1 Machinery damaged my hearing on one side in ninety.. sometimes touch that ear because I missed a word, not because I'm hiding the answer.. repeat it once, please
  fx.1 reveal f_hearing
  fx.2 set flag:hearing_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_NOW_HURT.d
  t.any.1 Would rather sit a minute before anyone examines me
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1296.VQ_NOW_HURT.d2
  t.any.1 No public inspection, please
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1296.VQ_NOW_HURT.d3
  t.any.1 No touching my ear.. ASK before you come closer
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1296.VQ_NOW_PARTNER
  t.any.1 Leticia is unwell and wants a doctor.. better to ask her for the symptoms
  t.any.2 She's kept walking, but isn't well.. being her husband doesn't make me a doctor
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_NOW_PLAN
  t.any.1 Rest first, then find out about a doctor.. no good plan comes from me half asleep
  t.any.2 Stop long enough to compare what we know.. not keep walking simply to look useful
  t.any.3 Need to choose a road for myself. I don't know enough to choose yours
  t.any.4 Not settled. I would like to say so without it sounding like an excuse
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_NOW_TIRED
  t.lo.1 Brief sleep beside a parked farm trailer last night.. not enough
  t.mid.1 Slept briefly by a parked farm trailer before daylight.. woke stiff and kept going
  t.hi.1 Last proper bed was before leaving the farm.. the trailer stop was a pause, not a night's rest
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_NOW_WANT
  t.any.1 Rest.. somewhere I can stop bracing to stand up again
  t.any.2 A dry place and enough quiet for sleep.. know a host can only offer so much
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_OFFER_BLANKET
  t.any.1 If spare.. something to keep the chill off while resting
  t.any.2 Yes.. a blanket doesn't have to look new to work
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_OFFER_DRINK
  t.any.1 Yes, please.. water before more talk would help
  t.any.2 A little to drink is plenty.. keep enough for yourself
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_OFFER_FOOD
  t.any.1 Yes, gracias.. anything ordinary you can share would be welcome
  t.any.2 Would welcome it.. you needn't feed me enough for a week's work
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_DAYONE
  t.lo.1 Working at the farm.. warnings reached us late, after chores
  t.mid.1 Looked up from work and couldn't tell whether the men by the road were waiting or leaving
  t.hi.1 Kept asking who had actually heard the radio.. every answer named somebody else
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_FAMILY
  t.lo.1 Leticia, my wife.. parents near Radcliff, but no current word
  t.mid.1 Cousin Julia too.. the binoculars belong to her, so I haven't called them mine
  t.hi.1 Benito taught me birds while we waited for his lift to work.. waiting was most of the lesson
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_FIRSTJOB
  t.any.1 Helping with tobacco at fourteen.. full shifts came later
  t.any.2 First pay went home.. Benito gave some back and told me a boy needed his own pencil
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_HOBBY
  gate.rule trust>=12
  t.any.1 Bird watching with borrowed binoculars after work.. should correct our farm while I'm saying borrowed.. employer's land, not mine.. let people think I owned it because farmhand felt too small an answer
  fx.1 reveal f_ground
  fx.2 set flag:ground_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_HOBBY.d
  t.any.1 Bird watching after work.. prefer talking about the birds
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_HOBBY.d2
  t.any.1 Not every question about Saturday needs my whole employment history
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_HOBBY.d3
  t.any.1 Enough about whose ground.. can leave the question unanswered
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_HOUSE
  t.any.1 Rented room near the farm.. had space for the bag if you put it under the bed
  t.any.2 A small place.. window faced a fence, which made the view better than it sounds
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_LASTNORMAL
  t.any.1 Borrowed a clean shirt and worried it looked borrowed.. wish that was still the trouble
  t.any.2 Julia asking whether I'd found any new birds.. expected an answer next visit
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_LOVE
  t.any.1 Leticia.. met in ninety, I was eighteen and she was twenty-five
  t.any.2 Married last year.. twenty and twenty-seven then, both quite able to argue our own side
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_MONEY
  gate.rule trust>=57 & alone & partnerGone & flag:hearing_told
  t.hi.1 Wages were tight.. Julia lent the Graceland money and I still owe it.. Leticia thinks I paid her back.. kept putting the payment behind the next week's needs, then let silence pretend it was settled
  fx.1 reveal f_julia
  fx.2 set flag:julia_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_MONEY.d
  t.any.1 Farm wages.. not much beyond the week's bills
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_MONEY.d2
  t.any.1 Julia's lending isn't a subject for everybody
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_MONEY.d3
  t.any.1 Leave my wife's name out of the arithmetic
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_PARENTS
  t.any.1 Benito and Elena.. Spanish at home, English when a neighbor stopped in
  t.any.2 Father would make me look twice before naming a bird.. Mother wanted the same care with people's names
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_PETS
  gate.rule trust>=27 & alone & partnerGone & flag:ground_told
  t.any.1 Nube.. Alonso's dog, not ours.. promised I'd bring him when the workers left, then went without him.. still tied when I last saw him.. don't know what happened after, no matter what I fear
  fx.1 reveal f_dog
  fx.2 set flag:dog_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_PETS.d
  t.any.1 A dog at the farm.. don't want to talk about him
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_PETS.d2
  t.any.1 Not giving you the name so you can keep asking it
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_PETS.d3
  t.any.1 STOP.. no calling for a dog you haven't seen
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_PROUD
  gate.rule trust>=72 & alone & partnerGone & flag:julia_told
  t.hi.1 A small repair.. learned hand sewing to mend Leticia's old monogrammed handkerchief, the one from her mother.. did it quietly.. not proud of being secretive, proud the cloth held without losing what she kept it for
  fx.1 reveal f_thread
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_PROUD.d
  t.any.1 A bird list Julia said was honest.. proud of the question marks
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_PROUD.d2
  t.any.1 Some small work belongs between the people involved
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_PROUD.d3
  t.any.1 No.. won't fetch Leticia's things to demonstrate it
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL
  t.any.1 County schools.. the bus ride made the day long before lessons started
  t.any.2 School bus hill was the walk home from the stop.. could tell the season by how dark it was
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_TOWN
  t.any.1 Radcliff was where we bought things.. home was the hollow and the ride back
  t.any.2 Knew the bus stops better than the streets.. people describe a town differently when they drive
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_TRAVEL
  t.any.1 Memphis, Graceland, in ninety-one with Leticia.. farthest I'd been
  t.any.2 Saw Graceland in ninety-one.. came home with a ticket and more memories of the drive than the rooms
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_WORK
  gate.rule !flag:ground_told
  t.lo.1 Our farm near Radcliff.. mostly tobacco work
  t.mid.1 Tobacco and whatever else needed hands.. our place always had something unfinished
  t.hi.1 Farm work.. used to feel that knowing every fence was almost the same as having a say
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_PAST_WORK.a2
  gate.rule flag:ground_told
  t.any.1 Farmhand on an employer's ground.. you've heard why I should say that plainly
  t.any.2 Tobacco work for wages.. knowledge of the fences wasn't ownership
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_TALK_ADVICE
  t.any.1 Ask whether a thing is borrowed before deciding its owner can spare it
  t.any.2 One fence over isn't far until you're the person who has to climb back
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_TALK_AGE
  t.any.1 Twenty-one.. old enough to remember being paid less for being young
  t.any.2 Born in seventy-two.. Benito still checks whether I brought a jacket
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_TALK_DISLIKES
  t.any.1 People deciding a question has been answered badly before I finish it
  t.any.2 An employer calling every loose tool ours until one disappears
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_TALK_FEAR
  t.lo.1 Being blamed before anyone asks where I was
  t.mid.1 A missing tool can become my trouble just because I used it last
  t.hi.1 Sometimes hear an accusation you haven't made.. can tell me when I'm answering that instead of you
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_TALK_FOOD
  t.any.1 Beans the way Benito makes them.. plenty of onion, no speech about being grateful
  t.any.2 Warm tortillas.. could eat them plain without getting bored of the idea
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_TALK_FROM
  t.any.1 A hollow outside Radcliff.. long school bus ride across the county
  t.any.2 Near Radcliff.. born there, though people sometimes ask the question twice
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_TALK_HABIT
  t.any.1 Touching my ear?.. happens when I'm choosing the answer.. no secret signal
  t.any.2 Didn't notice my hand there.. can leave it alone without you watching it for a confession
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_TALK_HOPE
  t.any.1 Rest enough to be curious again.. tiredness makes every new thing sound like work
  t.any.2 A doctor available for Leticia.. won't invent one just because the wish is strong
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_TALK_HOWARE
  t.lo.1 Tired enough that a level floor sounds generous
  t.mid.1 Still walking like the school bus hill is ahead of me.. wish my legs would listen
  t.mid.2 Getting by. That is my answer, not a claim about everybody else
  t.mid.3 Would rather you asked than decided by looking at me
  t.mid.4 Better talking without having to explain where my English came from
  t.hi.1 Less ready to defend myself over an ordinary question.. can probably ask one back now
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_TALK_LIKES
  t.any.1 Watching swallows with the borrowed binoculars.. trying to catch the turn before they make it
  t.any.2 Walking one fence over after work to see whether the same birds stayed
  t.any.3 Birds doing something I haven't noticed before. No need to catch them at it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_TALK_MUSIC
  t.any.1 Spanish radio at Benito's.. like the songs, not the man shouting between them
  t.any.2 Slow guitar music.. don't need to know every word to let a tune finish
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_TALK_NAME
  t.any.1 Raul Aguilar.. Raul is enough, please
  t.any.2 Aguilar.. if you want to write it, let me say it slowly instead of guessing
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_TALK_PRAYER
  t.any.1 Yes.. quieter when I'm afraid, though I don't know why volume should matter
  t.any.2 Pray for Leticia and our families.. don't have an explanation to offer with it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_TALK_QUIET
  t.any.1 Gladly.. don't need to make an interesting bird out of every sound
  t.any.2 Yes.. may close my eyes, but that isn't a promise I can sleep
  t.any.3 Quiet is fine. You do not need to leave me alone to give me some
  t.any.4 Stay if you want. We needn't find another question just yet
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_TALK_SLEEP
  t.any.1 Badly.. almost asleep, then trying to identify the sound that woke me
  t.any.2 A proper rest would help.. not another pause where I keep one shoe braced to stand
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_TALK_STORY
  t.mid.1 Julia lent the binoculars and asked for a bird list.. first page had six question marks and one crow
  t.hi.1 Julia read my bird list.. said six question marks proved I was looking, but the one crow had been outside her window the whole time
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_TALK_WEATHER
  t.any.1 Not sure about rain.. swallows aren't giving me a signed forecast
  t.any.2 Clouds can change while a man is explaining them.. prefer a roof to my opinion
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_WORLD_ANIMALS
  t.any.1 Saw birds along our road.. didn't see livestock loose on that stretch
  t.any.2 Swallows were flying near a shed when we passed.. can't say what that means beyond swallows
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_WORLD_HOPE
  t.any.1 Hope it ends.. can't imagine everything returning exactly as it was
  t.any.2 Would like ordinary work again.. don't think the people doing it would be quite the same
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.VQ_WORLD_NEWS
  t.any.1 Nothing current.. farm warnings reached us through other people, not a clear broadcast
  t.any.2 Heard people say keep moving.. nobody named a place they had just checked
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1296.leave.angry
  t.any.1 Leaving now.. don't want the last thing I say here to make it worse
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1296.leave.grateful
  t.any.1 Gracias.. will keep this stop in mind without making you a promise for next time
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1296.leave.need_met
  t.any.1 This helped.. the road doesn't seem to be asking quite so much now
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1296.leave.plain
  t.any.1 Have the borrowed binoculars.. Julia would ask about those before asking about me
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1296.react.compliment
  t.any.1 Thank you.. almost tried to make the praise larger, better leave it as it is
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1296.react.gave_blanket
  t.any.1 Enough to keep the cold from choosing every thought.. thank you
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1296.react.gave_book
  t.any.1 Thank you.. will keep it dry beside the notebook
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1296.react.gave_food
  t.any.1 Gracias.. hungry enough that the first useful thing is to stop talking
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1296.react.gave_water
  t.any.1 That helps.. could hear the dryness in my own voice
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1296.react.ignored
  t.any.1 Here when you can answer.. waiting, not agreeing to anything
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1296.react.insult
  t.any.1 No.. don't need to accept that just because I'm tired
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1296.react.offered_bed
  t.any.1 Yes.. will ask where rather than guess which place is mine
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1296.react.refused
  t.any.1 Then I'll stop asking.. not going to turn your no into a quarrel
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1296.react.sorry
  t.any.1 Alright.. can put the question down now
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1296.react.thanks
  t.any.1 You're welcome.. good to have helped instead of only asking
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1296.react.threat
  t.any.1 Will step away.. nothing in my hands, look before you decide
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1296.return.arrive
  t.any.1 Raul again.. remembered this door without putting it in the bird notebook
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1296.return.gave_food
  gate.rule gaveever:food
  t.any.1 The food mattered last time.. came back remembering that, not expecting it
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1296.return.refused_door
  t.any.1 You wouldn't let me in last time.. can ask again from here?
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1296.return.threatened
  t.any.1 Bag stays shut.. would rather use words this time, if you'll allow it
  tag.1 kind:return
end
